# aurora.local / packages/dashboard / caddy.snippet
#
# Aurora is served at the apex $DOMAIN (see packages/core/caddy/Caddyfile).
# This snippet is intentionally empty so that packages/dashboard drops in
# cleanly without adding a duplicate vhost. If you ever want a distinct
# admin subdomain (e.g. because Aurora runs alongside a public site on
# the same box), add:
#
#   http://admin.{$DOMAIN}  { reverse_proxy aurora:8090 }
#   https://admin.{$DOMAIN} { tls internal; reverse_proxy aurora:8090 }
